<title>POLAND: PAGED 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 9.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PAGED 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 9.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
